# CQ-02: 工作面的沉陷影响波及哪些敏感点？各敏感点配了什么防护措施？（[causes,affects] 链 + protected_by）
# 图约定：链结论 graph:derived:chain_impact_on_receptor（Task 8 草案链 impact_on_receptor=[causes,affects]）；断言边 graph:asserted。
PREFIX eia: <https://ontology.eai-flow.com/eia#>
PREFIX pred: <https://ontology.eai-flow.com/eia#predicate/>
SELECT ?face ?impact ?sp ?measure WHERE {
  GRAPH <graph:derived:chain_impact_on_receptor> { ?face pred:impact_on_receptor ?sp }
  GRAPH <graph:asserted> {
    ?face pred:causes ?impact .
    ?impact pred:affects ?sp .
    OPTIONAL { ?sp pred:protected_by ?measure }
  }
}
